{"id":"ec34c5dafbb292c4","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-wellfounded-iteration.md","title":"ZFC Wellfounded Iteration","display":"df-zfc-wellfounded-iteration — ZFC Wellfounded Iteration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-wellfounded-iteration","aliases":["58-df-zfc-wellfounded-iteration"],"display":"df-zfc-wellfounded-iteration — ZFC Wellfounded Iteration","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-wellfounded-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-wellfounded-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-wellfounded-iteration — ZFC Wellfounded Iteration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md\">../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (iteration-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (well-founded-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md\">../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellfoundedIteration}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{WellfoundedIteration}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}iteration} \\vdash \\mathrm{WellfoundedIteration}_S(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M,\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\;\\mathrm{WF}(\\in^{M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T}},M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}iteration} \\vdash \\mathrm{WellfoundedIteration}_S(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M,\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\;\\mathrm{WF}(\\in^{M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T}},M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md","status":"resolved","id":"7308daa58e0345ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (iteration-tree predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md","status":"resolved","id":"7308daa58e0345ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}\\subseteq V^2$ (well-founded-relation predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellfoundedIteration}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}iteration} \\vdash \\mathrm{WellfoundedIteration}_S(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M,\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\theta\\;\\mathrm{WF}(\\in^{M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T}},M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T})\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1223,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3866","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-wellfounded-iteration.md|58-df-zfc-wellfounded-iteration]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["92fbda0605a6cb98","7308daa58e0345ed","5582a281f15a33c2"]}